WEBVTT

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.000
Excuse me.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.010
Shinra-sama, it's morning.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:00.700
Ren?

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:01.950
Yes.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.840
I had too much to drink and my head hurts.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.510
I'm going back to sleep.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:11.710
As I was ordered to wake you up at this time...

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:13.000
Please excuse me.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.220
My name is Uesugi Ren.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.250
Occupation: Butler.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.270
In training...

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.100
I'm refreshed.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.250
Good morning, Master.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.010
Good morning, Ren.

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:04.730
Answer me, Ren.

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.510
What is a butler?

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.480
One who serves Ojou-sama and everyone.

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.650
You fool!

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:21.160
A butler is someone who supports Ojou-sama and everybody from the bottom of his heart!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.120
Wasn't I right just now...

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:29.530
I can't feel your spirit in the way you said it.

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.510
What?!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:35.210
Say it with loyalty towards your master!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:40.050
Right, what the master owns is the master's,
and what the butler owns is also the master's.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.010
In other words, I lack the fiery attitude, huh.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.630
In that case!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.810
I'll serve with all my might!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.860
Whoa, that's pretty neat.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:03.550
With that raging spirit of yours, aim for it, Ren.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.080
A bona fide butler.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.520
Hey, Hato-nee.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.450
Yes? What is it?

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.770
I wonder if the old man is searching for us.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.410
I don't think he's the type of person who would search.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:12.740
I see.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.250
Damn!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.380
Just when we're running off to the city, I have to think of that violent old man!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.420
Ren-chan.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.170
Hato-nee.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.930
As siblings, let's become happy.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:34.060
Sure, we'll be together forever, Ren-chan.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.270
Hato-nee.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:54.620
We've arrived at Nanahama, the port city full of young people!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.350
This is what you call a city. It's bustling.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.630
Let's split up and find work.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.520
You bet. Somewhere we can live-in.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.140
I'm going to aim right for it.

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.120
Then, I'll meet you here at night.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.590
Okay, but don't follow any woman even if she makes an advance towards you.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:21.150
Yeah.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:33.000
He may be my younger brother, but he's so obedient and wonderful.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.400
This is the start of my career.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.560
I don't take live-ins.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.720
Your stare looks sinister.

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.890
We can't afford to hire people.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.690
That aside, how about it, kid?

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.440
E-Excuse me!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.880
Zilch, huh.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.370
It's a cruel world.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:41.230
Cool.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.920
Kuonji Shinra...

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.760
A beauty, just like Hato-nee.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.440
Her house is huge. I'd sure like to live like that.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:56.240
It's about time I went back.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:14.220
Whoa... Hey lady, I'm Shibuya Takuya. Would you like to go out with me?

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.600
Sorry, but I have a brother complex.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.590
Come on, don't say such things.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:27.060
S-See you next time.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.650
What's with that guy? You can't lower your guard even for a second.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.570
My, Ren-chan!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.070
Hato-nee, did you find any work?

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.170
No, not at all.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.350
I see. Me neither.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.830
In any case, let's go for a change in scenery.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.390
Paradise, paradise.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.250
Yeah.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.360
So we have to sleep outside. Sorry.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.330
It's okay.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:19.950
I refreshed myself at the spa, although it was expensive.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:24.200
Hato-nee, you're a girl. You need to take a bath.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.460
This is a return favor for being so kind, Ren-chan.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.170
To explain things:

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:35.880
Uesugi Mihato stores forty-nine secret tools throughout her body.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:40.180
Tada! Onee-chan's secret tool, instant ramen!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:44.770
Right on! But, it'll be bad for your beauty with only that.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:46.430
If we only had some leeks.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:50.150
Even I don't carry leeks with me.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:55.190
But, I think spinach will do the job.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:58.850
Whoa! Hato-nee, you're amazing!

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:27.180
I'll never go back to a home like that.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:33.940
I'll be the one who'll make Hato-nee happy.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.910
It sure is hot today.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.970
I'm taking a break.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.240
I have to find a job fast.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:54.220
Huh?

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.510
What was that?

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.760
You're in a good mood, Miyu.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.790
Well, all of the people are looking at me.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.740
Am I that attractive?

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.960
Hey, hey, it's hot today.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:36.960
There's no way a person like me with an IQ of 240 will succumb to a heatstroke.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.970
Somehow, my head is feeling...

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.340
Hey, Miyu, hey, hey...

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.100
Hey, watch out!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:48.760
Hey, Miyu!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:48.760
Huh?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.210
What's with that girl? She fainted.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.650
Hey, Ojou-chan, are you all right?

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:02.650
I'm not at an age where you can call me "Ojou-chan".

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.530
What are you saying, Ojou-chan?

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.200
You look all pale.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.850
You should go to a hospital.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.620
It's only a case of anemia. Let me down.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.080
My sister told me this:

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:17.710
If somebody is in distress, save that person unless it's from debt.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:24.260
Don't worry. I'll bring that radio controlled thing with me.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.510
Hey! I'm not radio controlled!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.470
Whoa, it responded to my words!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:34.820
I'm De Niro, made by Miyu. Remember the name, you got that?

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:36.280
Er... yeah.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:40.400
Shit, why is it that I can't defy his bully-like voice?

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.610
When I have the urge to question him thoroughly!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:46.000
Ren-chan, what are you doing with this lady?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.010
I'm helping her out.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.010
My, that's wonderful!

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.770
I'm Kuonji Miyu, not some little girl.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:53.120
Ah, sorry about that.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.770
Here.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.450
Such meddlesome people.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.020
People have to help each other out in times of trouble.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.360
Right on, Hato-nee.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:12.350
Yes, since doves are the symbol of peace, kuruppo!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:15.230
You two are funny people.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.470
Then, please take me to my house.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:19.860
De Niro, navigate them to the Kuonji residence.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.640
Leave it to me. Come on, follow me!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.330
Huh? Kuonji?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.240
No way.

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.370
This is it.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.010
Whoa, it's huge!

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.750
This is pretty impressive.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.440
Miyu-sama!

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.010
Huh?

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.170
Is anything the matter?

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.720
Did something take place?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.000
Yeah, to make the story concise...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.000
Awesome! Are those two what they call servants?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.310
Yes, that's right.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.000
Several stewards in the household.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.730
Can this perhaps be...

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.720
Our chance for work?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.430
You sure have an appetite.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.140
Which is masculine and fine.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:32.640
Grow stronger.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:33.370
Seconds!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.140
Please eat as much as you like.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:39.320
As you are Miyu-sama's savior, you must receive our hospitality.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:41.650
On the contrary, I feel indebted.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.170
This entree is joue de boeuf, stewed in red wine.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.650
Maids actually exist, huh.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.260
Your uniform is cute and nice.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.870
Whoa, this dish tastes great, too!

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.870
Thank you very much.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.000
All of the food was prepared by Benisu.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.370
What? P-P-Peni...

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:05.360
No, B as in bear, it's Benisu.

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.390
Oh, I see. Sorry.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.760
Your cooking is great!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.130
It has an elegant taste, doesn't it?

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.720
Hato-nee's is great, but this is just as good.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.080
I guess the ingredients must be good.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.240
Are you going to credit the dish to its ingredients?

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:22.990
Hmph, who knows if what this Hato-nee person cooks tastes good at all.

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.250
What did you say?

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.860
What? Do you want to fight?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.060
Allow me to apologize.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.740
Move out of the way. This maid just pissed me off.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:35.910
Please forgive us on account of my pretty smile.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:36.800
Grin.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.240
No, I don't need it.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.030
In any case, get out of my way!

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:41.460
This maid made me...

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.460
Ren-chan!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.400
I am deeply sorry.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.340
When I get pushed, my spinal reaction acts up.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.370
The Colonel is an ex-mercenary, you know.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.220
You're going to get kicked right out of here.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.970
Beni, you ought to keep quiet.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.470
What are you thinking of, kicking me all of a sudden?

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:03.530
Sorry, but with that kind of attitude, you'll only trouble your sister.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.760
Do you think I'm going to shut up after being kicked?

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:09.360
Still being unruly, and saving what little pride you hold.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.860
Let me teach you a lesson.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.180
Hand beams are an integral part of a butler.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.280
Ren-chan!

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:29.380
Rest assured, I made sure I pulled my punches.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.270
W-What the hell is with that guy?

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.020
Huh?

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.240
Who are you?

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.000
I'm Uesugi Ren.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:07.040
And you're Kuonji...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.520
Shinra.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.000
As I thought, this house is...

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:15.380
How casual of you.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.080
You can call me Shinra-sama.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.000
Huh?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.020
Shinra-sama, welcome home.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.230
Bastard!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.750
What a spunky one.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.220
Go to sleep.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.270
Not yet... not yet.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.090
Huh? Aren't you going to fall?

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:38.740
What's with this guy?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.490
He passed out while standing.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.790
What an interesting guy.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.000
I think it's about time you explain why the two of you are traveling.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.010
Huh?

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.840
I understand you have your reasons.

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:00.260
Yes!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:04.350
This is my chance! Onee-chan is going to do her best!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.770
I won't let Ren-chan's injury go to waste!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.610
He woke up!

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:19.010
Huh? Where am I?

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:20.520
Hato-nee...

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:22.120
Yeah, I was...

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.950
Oh, Shinra.

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.830
S-Sama...

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.330
That's right. That kind of language will be just fine.

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.800
Since you'll be working here from now on.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.780
Huh?

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:41.240
After I explained our situation, they agreed to hire us as live-ins.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.810
That easily?

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:43.550
Is it okay?

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.660
Not so easy.

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.520
There will be a one week probationary period.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:52.310
If it is determined that you lack the necessary skills to work...

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:54.500
You will be fired mercilessly.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.820
Well, you should have no problems if you do your job normally.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.560
Y-Yes, I'll do my best!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.330
Thank you very much!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:09.520
People have to help each other out in times of trouble. That's what you said.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.480
And it seems like you saved my beloved sister.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.090
After I went through the trouble of making you wear that hat, you loli.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.270
You wouldn't have collapsed from anemia if you didn't try to prove yourself.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:21.590
I'm not a loli, but a grown-up woman, hmph.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:25.570
Since you're about the same age as Yume and it sounds fun, you're more than welcome!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:26.220
Who are you?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.330
Don't mind him, Yume!

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.980
Yume isn't discouraged.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.970
First of all, we must get acquainted with your name and face.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.790
Shinra comes from shinrabanshou...

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:45.780
Meaning: Everything that exists in the universe.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:50.330
Therefore, as a token of your awe upon witnessing such grandeur...

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.540
Call me "Shinra-sama".

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.080
Uh, yeah...

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:59.120
My interests include loving cute things.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.090
Shinra-sama!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:06.300
I'm Miyu, the sexy and prodigious second daughter, smooch.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.770
She's a loli and a freeter, so you don't have to add the "sama" honorifics.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.210
Hey, Nee-san!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.870
Your angry face is also cute!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:15.900
Hey, stop that!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.820
Ah, young sisters are wonderful! It's the immaculate culture.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.070
Younger brothers are also wonderful, you know.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.530
Shucks, everyone is so unique.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.250
Don't lose, Yume!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.010
Yume, you're the type who can do it if you put your mind to it!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.290
Natose-san, yeah!

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:33.750
I'm Yume, the third daughter from the Kuonji family.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.270
My hobby is ham radio, and my forte is clam digging.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:41.300
Now my unique character will surely be recognized.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.740
Huh? Oh, nice to meet you.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.670
Huh?

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.590
It's more like minority rather than unique.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.600
I failed again!

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.830
I am the maid chief.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:57.810
If you're going to work here, follow my elegant commands.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.600
Um, what was your name again?

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.370
I already told you, it's Benisu!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:05.820
T-That's right, it's nice to meet you.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.630
Hato-nee, it's rude to laugh.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.190
Same to you, Ren-chan!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.830
These two annoy the heck out of me!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.540
My name is Natose.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:20.570
I'm in charge of security and cultivating the flowers.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:21.710
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.340
Sure. This person sounds normal, what a relief.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:30.630
Hey, Beni, I'm hungry,.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.350
I guess I don't have a choice then.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.290
There, can you catch it?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.910
Piece of cake, piece of cake!

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:57.370
Just as I thought, this person isn't normal, either!

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:03.530
I'm Chiharu, in charge of cleaning duties.

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:04.800
Nice to meet you.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.000
Whoa, cute!

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:07.470
Chiharu is a boy, you know.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:08.880
What a punch line.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:14.040
And I'm the Colonel, also the legal guardian of Ojou-sama and the others.

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:15.140
What's your real name?

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.610
Tajiri Yasushi.

00:22:17.610 --> 00:22:19.350
I-I'll call you Colonel.

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:24.230
So, to start things off, complete your one week probationary period.

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:26.220
Let's do our best, Ren-chan!

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:28.950
Yeah, since this is our big chance.

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:30.000
Snuggle.

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:33.910
Such interesting people.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:38.420
It looks like things will get rowdy once again.

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:15.710
In episode two, Ren is going to transfer to the school of which I'm the student council president.

00:24:15.710 --> 00:24:18.350
That's a different butler anime!

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:20.680
To tell you the truth, there's going to be a major plot twist.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.500
Huh? What's going to happen?

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.140
Well...
